    - rid: 4952170771345571856
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: The facade is damaged and almost everything outside needs work.
    - rid: 4952170771345571858
      type: {class: ImageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2d27a24a57cfecf4aa07285e70311e4e, type: 3}
    - rid: 5520886851360522241
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: But Grandma never chose the easy option.
    - rid: 5520886851360522242
      type: {class: ImageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c455bd5870a507f48b10616f5d518039, type: 3}
    - rid: 5520886851360522243
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Her coffee recipes are still here. I could open a small coffee stand
          and use the earnings for repairs.
    - rid: 5520886851360522244
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: One cup, one repair, and one piece of home at a time.
    - rid: 5520886963192201216
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: "Grandmas house\u2026 I remember it being much brighter."
